    "block.chemical_industry.galena_ore.detail": "§7挖掘掉落 §f方铅矿§7（方块本身）。\n§7生成于主世界地下。\n§7在沸腾炉中用碳还原 → §8铅锭",
    "block.chemical_industry.cassiterite_ore.detail": "§7挖掘掉落 §f锡石§7（方块本身）。\n§7生成于主世界地下。\n§7在沸腾炉中用碳还原 → §f锡锭",
    "block.chemical_industry.cinnabar_ore.detail": "§7挖掘掉落 §c朱砂§7（方块本身）。\n§7生成于主世界地下。\n§7在沸腾炉中加热 → §b水银",
    "block.chemical_industry.condenser_pipe.detail": "放在鼓风机前方，泵入压缩空气。\n鼓风机气流可穿透，变为冷风。\n水→冰 岩浆→原石 岩浆块→石头。\n生物受细雪式冻伤。",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.electrolyzer_structure.header": "搭建电解槽",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.electrolyzer_structure.text_1": "合法的电解槽由三个横排的电解槽方块组成",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.electrolyzer_structure.text_2": "它有 3×1、3×2、3×3 三种规格",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.electrolyzer_power.header": "动能与通电",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.electrolyzer_power.text_1": "流体物质需要通过动力泵输入和输出",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.electrolyzer_power.text_2": "电解槽需要通电才能工作",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.electrolyzer_use.header": "放入电极",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.electrolyzer_use.text_1": "电解槽需要电极",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.electrolyzer_use.text_2": "有时需要催化剂和别的一些物质",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.electrolyzer_heat.header": "加热与警示",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.electrolyzer_heat.text_1": "有时电解槽需要加热才能运行",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.electrolyzer_heat.text_2": "注意：电解千万条，安全第一条！",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.electrolyzer_power.text_3": "这是阳极",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.electrolyzer_power.text_4": "这是阴极",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.fluidized_bed_structure.header": "搭建沸腾炉",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.fluidized_bed_structure.text_1": "先搭一个 2×2×3 的 Create 储罐柱",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.fluidized_bed_structure.text_2": "柱子越高，容量越大",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.fluidized_bed_structure.text_3": "手持沸腾炉控制器右键储罐，柱体就会变成沸腾炉",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.fluidized_bed_use.header": "沸腾炉运行",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.fluidized_bed_use.text_1": "转化后的沸腾炉：底层进料、中层反应、顶层出气",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.fluidized_bed_use.text_2": "中层是反应核心：放入原料和催化剂",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.fluidized_bed_use.text_3": "顶层用于收集气体产物",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.fluidized_bed_use.text_4": "下方是烈焰人燃烧室——沸腾炉需要热源",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.fluidized_bed_use.text_5": "传送带和漏斗把原料送入中层",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.fluidized_bed_use.text_6": "液体原料（如水）从底层泵入",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.fluidized_bed_use.text_7": "气体产物从中层排出",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.fluidized_bed_use.text_8": "把硫磺粉放入中层，加热后与水反应生成硫酸",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.air_compressor_use.header": "空气压缩机",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.air_compressor_use.text_1": "空气压缩机把空气压缩成压缩空气",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.air_compressor_use.text_2": "它是动能机器：齿轮驱动，轴从背面接入",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.air_compressor_use.text_3": "用动力泵把压缩空气送入储罐",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.air_compressor_use.text_4": "转速越高，产气越快",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.air_compressor_distillation.header": "空气分馏",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.air_compressor_distillation.text_1": "空气压缩机产生压缩空气",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.air_compressor_distillation.text_2": "压缩空气经管道泵入分馏塔底层",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.air_compressor_distillation.text_3": "分馏塔由模组《机械动力：柴油动力》提供",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.air_compressor_distillation.text_4": "分离三种气体至少需要 4 层",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.air_compressor_distillation.text_5": "第 2、3、4 层分别输出氧气、氮气、稀有气体",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.air_compressor_distillation.text_6": "注意：分馏空气，千万不要加热哟",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.condenser_pipe_use.header": "冷凝管",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.condenser_pipe_use.text_1": "冷凝管向前方吹出冷风",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.condenser_pipe_use.text_2": "背面必须有鼓风机，它朝冷凝管吹风",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.condenser_pipe_use.text_3": "压缩空气由空气压缩机提供，经管道绕行泵入",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.condenser_pipe_use.text_4": "前方有水源时，冷风会把它冻成冰",
    "chemical_industry.ponder.condenser_pipe_use.text_5": "4 秒后，水结成冰！"
}